; Address of an object's name phrases
;
; Looks up the record of object or character A (#R$9BCA) and returns the
; address of its name phrase codes (record +8).
;
; A Object or character id
; O:HL Address of the name phrase codes
; O:DE, IX Preserved
@label=ObjectNamePtr
c$71E2 PUSH DE       ;
 $71E3 PUSH IX       ;
 $71E5 CALL $9BCA    ;
 $71E8 PUSH IX       ;
 $71EA POP HL        ;
 $71EB LD DE,$0008   ; record +8: first name phrase
 $71EE ADD HL,DE     ;
 $71EF POP IX        ;
 $71F1 POP DE        ;
 $71F2 RET           ;
